# Check every text file out with LF line endings on every OS. Sol embeds data files whose bytes
# are hashed or compared (the BIP-39 word list, golden test files, .ics fixtures); Git for
# Windows' default autocrlf would turn them into CRLF and break those checks.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
